+Tested-With:            GHC == 7.4.2, GHC == 7.6.3, GHC == 7.8.4, GHC == 7.10.1, GHC == 7.10.2, GHC == 7.10.3, GHC == 8.0.1, GHC == 8.0.2, GHC == 8.10.7, GHC == 9.8.4, GHC == 9.12.2
 
 Source-Repository head
